<view class="page"><view class="card"><view class="section-title">当前课程表</view><view class="row">课程表名称 <text>{{document.table.name}}</text></view><view class="row">总周数 <text>{{document.table.totalWeeks}} 周</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">常规课程时间</view><picker mode="selector" range="{{countOptions}}" value="{{periodCountIndex}}" bindchange="periodCountChange"><view class="row">每天节数 <text>{{periods.length}} 节</text></view></picker><block wx:for="{{periods}}" wx:key="index"><view class="period-row"><text class="period-number">第 {{item.index}} 节</text><picker mode="time" value="{{item.start}}" bindchange="periodTimeChange" data-index="{{index}}" data-key="start"><text>{{item.start}}</text></picker><text>至</text><picker mode="time" value="{{item.end}}" bindchange="periodTimeChange" data-index="{{index}}" data-key="end"><text>{{item.end}}</text></picker></view></block><button class="button-primary save-periods" bindtap="savePeriods">保存时间设置</button><view class="muted">常规课程按这里的节次时间计算，不规则课程仍可单独填写时间。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">提醒</view><view class="row">Apple 日历 <text>小程序暂不支持</text></view><button class="button-plain subscribe" bindtap="subscribe">订阅课程提醒</button><view class="muted result" wx:if="{{reminderMessage}}">{{reminderMessage}}</view><view class="row">课程提醒发送 <text>需服务端配置</text></view></view></view>
